    <informations>Credit: Charles Ferrand, 2 Relay Module Novembre 2013

Yachal Upson, October 2026
Including Pin names and jumper detail

Vcc_CTRL and Vcc_JUMPER are permanently connected by the PCB.
The removable jumper between Vcc_JUMPER and JD-Vcc is normally fitted.
Internal connection and jumper graphics are explanatory only.</informations>
